{
  "name": "TestLastActionInRecoveryChainPropagates",
  "comment": "Recovery chain runs in order, intermediate actions execute, and RunRecovery returns the chain's final Data (handle.cs:177-184 — `last = await action.RunAsync(...); ...; return last`). Three sequential variable.sets prove: (a) all three executed (side-effects observable), (b) the terminal value is the chain's last set, (c) %!error% is suppressed — the chain reached the success-return path.",
  "step": [
